    {
      "number": 4,
      "pali": "“Rūpā, bhikkhave, aniccā atītā anāgatā paccuppannā. ",
      "english": "“Mendicants, in the past … future … present sights, sounds, smells, tastes, touches, and ideas are impermanent. "
    },
